index 00000000..1b02cac3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/3434.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fixed a ``ValueError`` when connecting to an HTTPS proxy with a ``proxy_ssl_context`` that verifies certificates while the connection's ``ssl_context`` disables verification. The proxy connection now uses the verification mode of the ``proxy_ssl_context`` instead of the target connection's ``cert_reqs``.
